sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant App as Lazee App
  participant SDK as Lazee SDK
  participant Relay as Sponsor Relay
  participant Account as Lazee Account
  participant RPC as Stellar RPC
  participant Indexer as Indexer

  U->>App: Click Create Lazee Account
  App->>SDK: start account creation
  SDK->>U: passkey-style approval
  SDK->>Relay: submit sponsored account tx
  Relay->>RPC: simulate transaction
  RPC-->>Relay: simulation result
  Relay->>RPC: sponsor and submit
  RPC->>Account: initialize signer and account state
  Account-->>RPC: AccountCreated event
  RPC-->>Relay: transaction hash
  Relay-->>SDK: receipt
  SDK->>Indexer: record receipt
  Indexer-->>App: account status
  App-->>U: show C-address and first action ready
